{"is_source_file": true, "format": "C", "description": "This file implements the 'mod_extforward' plugin for the lighttpd web server. It handles parsing of proxy forwarding headers, processes HAProxy protocol headers for transparent proxying, manages trusted proxy lists, and adjusts the perceived remote client address for request handling based on headers such as X-Forwarded-For and Forwarded. It also supports configuration of trusted proxies and chained proxy setups, including handling of IPv4, IPv6, and Unix domain sockets, and integrates with lighttpd's plugin system modules.", "external_files": ["first.h", "base.h", "log.h", "buffer.h", "http_header.h", "http_status.h", "request.h", "sock_addr.h", "plugin.h", "sys-socket.h"], "external_methods": ["buffer_eq_icase_slen", "http_header_hkey_get", "http_header_request_get", "http_header_env_set", "array_get_element_klen", "array_insert_value", "array_set_key_value", "array_free", "array_free_data", "array_init", "config_check_cond", "config_plugin_values_init", "light_isdigit", "light_isxdigit", "light_btst", "buffer_copy_string_len", "buffer_copy_string_len_lc", "buffer_eq_icase_ss", "buffer_eq_icase_ssn", "buffer_is_blank", "buffer_is_equal_string", "buffer_clen", "buffer_truncate", "memchr", "sock_addr_from_str_numeric", "sock_addr_inet_pton", "sock_addr_inet_ntop_copy_buffer", "sock_addr_assign", "sock_addr_get_family", "sock_addr_is_addr_eq_bits", "log_error", "log_perror", "http_request_host_policy", "config_cond_cache_reset_item", "ck_calloc", "free"], "published": ["mod_extforward_plugin_init"], "classes": [{"name": "handler_rctx", "description": "Per-request context storing destination address and buffer."}, {"name": "handler_ctx", "description": "Connection-level context tracking trust status and SSL client verification."}, {"name": "plugin_data", "description": "Main data structure for the plugin, including default configuration and token cache."}], "methods": [{"name": "mod_extforward_init", "description